he quadratic polynomial has roots ${z}_{1}=1-\\text{i}$ and ${z}_{2}=1+\\text{i},$ and the coefficient of the quadratic term is $a=2,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(z) & =a(z-{z}_{1})(z-{z}_{2}) \\\\  & =2\\cdot (z-(1-\\text{i}))(z-(1+\\text{i})) \\\\  & =2\\cdot ({z}^{2}-(1-\\text{i})z-(1+\\text{i})z+(1-\\text{i})(1+\\text{i})) \\\\  & =2\\cdot ({z}^{2}-(1-\\text{i}+1+\\text{i})z+((1)^{2}-(\\text{i})^{2})) \\\\  & =2\\cdot ({z}^{2}-(2)z+(1+1)) \\\\  & =2{z}^{2}-4z+4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can express the given set as follows:\n\n$$\n{1\\pm \\text{i}}={z\\in C\\,:\\,2{z}^{2}-4z+4=0}\n$$" 13194139534720 true] [17592186305456 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305457 13194139534720 true] [17592186305456 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305458 13194139534720 true] [17592186305456 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534720 true] [17592186305456 1041 "field-1" 13194139534720 true] [17592186305456 1104 #edb/ref 17592186305458 13194139534720 true] [17592186305456 1110 #uuid "48d3fdb6-e1f0-53ac-a3c4-40e619bb91ba" 13194139534720 true] [17592186305457 1034 "2" 13194139534720 true] [17592186305457 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534720 true] [17592186305457 1111 #uuid "001ff48a-3989-5c87-97ae-60eac749efe8" 13194139534720 true] [17592186305458 1034 "4" 13194139534720 true] [17592186305458 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534720 true] [17592186305458 1111 #uuid "d2e9e17d-2d3a-5e15-ab95-284b1328122e" 13194139534720 true] [17592186305459 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305460 13194139534720 true] [17592186305459 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534720 true] [17592186305459 1041 "field-2" 13194139534720 true] [17592186305459 1104 #edb/ref 17592186305460 13194139534720 true] [17592186305459 1110 #uuid "e39e029e-f164-5184-b659-77ae1ea78ea8" 13194139534720 true] [17592186305460 1034 "4" 13194139534720 true] [17592186305460 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534720 true] [17592186305460 1111 #uuid "67816c09-8f15-5905-9f04-0e8b8ec17417" 13194139534720 true] 